   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reg.Staistical Co-op.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Reg.statistik proj.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen syftar till kunskapsutveckling inom de baltiska staternas statistiska institut f&#xF6;r framtagning av p&#xE5;litlig statistik enligt EUs krav p&#xE5; omr&#xE5;det. L&#xE4;nderna prioriterar sj&#xE4;lva vilka av programmets 17 olika &#xE4;mnesinriktningar man vill f&#xF6;rdjupa sig i. Detta sker genom seminarier, studiebes&#xF6;k och workshops i samarbete med svenska SCB.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective is to enable the personnel at the statistical offices in the Baltic States to produce statistics following the requirements of the European Union. Each country make their own priorities for the projects 17 subactivities methodologically carried out through visits and workshops in cooperation with swedish SCB.</narrative>
  </description>
